# Sylvan Library: "At the beginning of your draw step, you may draw two additional cards. If you do, choose two cards in your
# hand drawn this turn. For each of those cards, pay 4 life or put the card on top of your library." "You always perform
# your normal draw before this ability" (its ruling; CR 504.1, 504.2): in Bot1's turn 3 draw step it draws the Island, then
# the ability resolves and it draws the Mountain and the Plains. Three cards in its hand were drawn this turn; it chooses
# the Mountain and the Plains, pays no life, and puts the Mountain back and then the Plains on top of it. The Island,
# drawn this turn but not chosen, stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Library
Swamp x4
Island
Mountain
Plains
Swamp x2

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sylvan Library.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Draw]
? Stack = Sylvan Library
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Mountain; Plains)
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Island
Bot1.Library = Plains; Mountain; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Life = 20
